      "metrics": {
        "title": "基础算法与本课实现",
        "html": "<div class=\"method-choice\" data-method=\"lstm-rop\"><div class=\"method-choice-heading\"><span class=\"mini\">TS / 时序分析 · 深度序列回归</span><h3>LSTM 工况序列回归</h3></div><svg class=\"network-diagram method-diagram\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 154\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LSTM 工况序列回归：有序工况记录 → LSTM传递井段状态 → 估计当前logROP → 还原ROP与残差\"><defs><marker id=\"method-arrow-m4-real\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M1 1L8 5L1 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6e9690\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"6\" y=\"30\" width=\"222\" height=\"86\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ede4d2\" stroke=\"#b9c4b2\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"62\" class=\"diagram-title\">有序工况记录</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"90\">4通道、最多12条</text><path d=\"M229 74h15\" stroke=\"#6e9690\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#method-arrow-m4-real)\"/><rect x=\"246\" y=\"30\" width=\"222\" height=\"86\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dbe8df\" stroke=\"#b9c4b2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"62\" class=\"diagram-title\">LSTM传递井段状态</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"90\">单向、12维记忆</text><path d=\"M469 74h15\" stroke=\"#6e9690\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#method-arrow-m4-real)\"/><rect x=\"486\" y=\"30\" width=\"222\" height=\"86\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ede4d2\" stroke=\"#b9c4b2\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"62\" class=\"diagram-title\">估计当前logROP</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"90\">含当前工况、不含ROP</text><path d=\"M709 74h15\" stroke=\"#6e9690\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#method-arrow-m4-real)\"/><rect x=\"726\" y=\"30\" width=\"222\" height=\"86\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ede4d2\" stroke=\"#b9c4b2\"/><text x=\"740\" y=\"62\" class=\"diagram-title\">还原ROP与残差</text><text x=\"740\" y=\"90\">沿井深寻找变化候选</text></svg><div class=\"method-contract\"><span><small>输入是什么</small>按井深排序的最多12条四通道工况记录</span><span><small>要得到什么</small>当前ROP估计与沿井深的残差变化</span></div><p class=\"method-reason\">总览将M4划为时序分析。钻进响应要放回连续井段中比较；LSTM沿井深读取钻压、转速、扭矩和流量，把前段工况状态带入当前钻速估计。</p><p class=\"fine\">深度顺序不等于等间隔时间；超过2 m的缺口断开。跨井回归仍需实测检验，残差不直接命名地层。 <a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/generated/torch.nn.LSTM.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">方法依据 ↗</a></p></div>"
